### Parklane Backend - Atal_Users request collection
### Residents, units, parking, visitors, maintenance and community.
### VS Code: install "REST Client". Everything is also runnable from /docs.

@host = http://localhost:8000
@api = {{host}}/api/users
@resident = youssef
@unit = H-601

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- overview

### Every resource with its document count and key
GET {{api}}


### --------------------------------------------------------------- residents

### List residents  (passwordHash is never returned)
GET {{api}}/residents

### Substring search across name, username and residentId
GET {{api}}/residents?q=youssef

### By business key
GET {{api}}/residents/{{resident}}

### ...or by ObjectId - both work on the same route
GET {{api}}/residents/000000000000000000000000

### Create a resident; the password is bcrypt-hashed on the way in
POST {{api}}/residents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "nour",
  "name": "Nour",
  "username": "nour.hassan@parklane.com",
  "password": "change-me",
  "unitCode": "H-602",
  "phone": "+20 10 1234 5678"
}

### Update metadata; omitting password leaves the stored hash untouched
PATCH {{api}}/residents/nour
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+20 10 9999 8888",
  "status": "active"
}

### Rotate the password - re-hashed, never echoed back
PATCH {{api}}/residents/nour
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "a-better-password"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{api}}/residents/nour


### ------------------------------------------------------------------- units

### All units
GET {{api}}/units

### Filter on a declared field
GET {{api}}/units?tower=Tower H

### An undeclared filter is rejected with the allowed list
GET {{api}}/units?colour=blue

### One unit, with finance, service charges and document availability
GET {{api}}/units/{{unit}}

### Update a nested block (replaces that block wholesale)
PATCH {{api}}/units/{{unit}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finance": {
    "unitPriceEGP": 6750000,
    "amountPaidEGP": 4725000,
    "remainingBalanceEGP": 2025000,
    "paidPercent": 70.0,
    "nextInstallmentEGP": 180000,
    "nextInstallmentDueDate": "2026-11-05",
    "remainingInstallments": 12
  }
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------- parking

### Vehicles
GET {{api}}/vehicles?residentId={{resident}}

### Allocated bays
GET {{api}}/parking-slots

### Building-wide occupancy, newest first - merged from both resident feeds
GET {{api}}/parking-occupancy?limit=5

### Occupancy over a window
GET {{api}}/parking-occupancy?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-02

### Is this resident's own bay occupied, over time
GET {{api}}/parking-slot-status?residentId={{resident}}&limit=10

### Only the moments the bay was in use
GET {{api}}/parking-slot-status?residentId={{resident}}&isActive=true&limit=10

### Entry / exit / guest events
GET {{api}}/parking-activity?residentId={{resident}}&type=car_entered&limit=10

### Guest parking requests
GET {{api}}/parking-guest-requests?residentId={{resident}}

### Raise a guest parking request
POST {{api}}/parking-guest-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "{{resident}}",
  "date": "2026-10-15",
  "startTime": "18:00:00",
  "endTime": "23:00:00",
  "guestCount": 2,
  "status": "Pending"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------- visitors

### Passes for one resident
GET {{api}}/visitor-passes?residentId={{resident}}

### Only upcoming ones
GET {{api}}/visitor-passes?residentId={{resident}}&kind=upcoming

### Search by visitor name or plate
GET {{api}}/visitor-passes?q=Ali

### Within a date window
GET {{api}}/visitor-passes?from=2026-09-22&to=2026-09-24

### Issue a pass
POST {{api}}/visitor-passes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "{{resident}}",
  "name": "Omar Khaled",
  "visitDate": "2026-10-12",
  "visitTime": "19:30:00",
  "guestCount": 2,
  "carPlate": "EGY 1234",
  "status": "Scheduled",
  "kind": "upcoming"
}

### Issue several at once
POST {{api}}/visitor-passes
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "residentId": "{{resident}}", "name": "Guest A", "visitDate": "2026-10-13", "visitTime": "18:00:00" },
  { "residentId": "{{resident}}", "name": "Guest B", "visitDate": "2026-10-14", "visitTime": "20:00:00" }
]

### Mark a pass as arrived - paste an _id from a list response
PATCH {{api}}/visitor-passes/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Arrived"
}

### Pass requests awaiting issue
GET {{api}}/visitor-pass-requests?residentId={{resident}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------- maintenance

### All tickets
GET {{api}}/maintenance-requests

### By status
GET {{api}}/maintenance-requests?status=Completed

### Search titles and categories
GET {{api}}/maintenance-requests?q=oven

### One ticket with its full status timeline and technician
GET {{api}}/maintenance-requests/REQ-2026-83328

### Raise a ticket
POST {{api}}/maintenance-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "REQ-2026-90001",
  "residentId": "{{resident}}",
  "unitCode": "{{unit}}",
  "category": "Plumbing",
  "title": "Kitchen tap dripping",
  "status": "Submitted",
  "submittedAt": "2026-10-10T09:00:00Z"
}

### Assign it
PATCH {{api}}/maintenance-requests/REQ-2026-90001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Assigned",
  "assignedAt": "2026-10-10T10:30:00Z",
  "technician": { "name": "Hassan Ibrahim", "contact": "+20 11 5758 3064" },
  "visit": { "date": "2026-10-11", "startTime": "10:00:00", "endTime": "12:00:00" }
}

### Close it
PATCH {{api}}/maintenance-requests/REQ-2026-90001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed",
  "completedAt": "2026-10-11T11:20:00Z"
}

### Remove it
DELETE {{api}}/maintenance-requests/REQ-2026-90001


### --------------------------------------------------------------- community

### Announcements (shared building-wide)
GET {{api}}/community-announcements

### Events
GET {{api}}/community-events

### One event
GET {{api}}/community-events/family-movie-night

### Who is going to what - the per-resident part
GET {{api}}/community-event-participation?residentId={{resident}}

### RSVP
PATCH {{api}}/community-event-participation/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionState": "I'm Going"
}

### Service alerts
GET {{api}}/community-alerts

### Polls, with shared results
GET {{api}}/community-polls

### How each resident voted
GET {{api}}/community-poll-votes

### Cast a vote
POST {{api}}/community-poll-votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "{{resident}}",
  "pollKey": "resident-priorities",
  "optionName": "More Community Events"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------- environment

### Site weather, newest first - merged from both resident feeds
GET {{api}}/weather?limit=5

### Over a window
GET {{api}}/weather?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-02

### Only one condition
GET {{api}}/weather?condition=Light Rain&limit=20


### ------------------------------------------------------------ bulk delete

### Refused without a filter
DELETE {{api}}/visitor-passes

### Allowed with a filter
DELETE {{api}}/visitor-passes?residentId=nour

### Or explicitly confirmed - empties the collection
DELETE {{api}}/visitor-passes?confirm=true
